{"seq":1,"slug":"weapon-ability-balancing","title":"武器与技能平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/balance-feel/weapon-ability-balancing","wordCount":1419,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"武器与技能平衡\">武器与技能平衡</h1><p>给玩家十把武器，如果其中一把各项都更强，那其余九把就成了摆设——平衡的失败不是「数值算错」，而是「玩家的选择被消灭」。武器与技能平衡的目标，不是让所有选项数值相等，而是让每个选项都在某些场景下是最优解，从而维持一个谁也不能通吃的生态。这一篇用「功率预算」和「击杀时间」两把尺子，把<a href=\"../hit-resolution/damage-formulas-scaling\">伤害公式</a>产出的数值约束成一个公平的博弈空间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-功率预算\">核心概念：功率预算</h2><p>平衡的底层思想是：每件武器/技能拥有一份大致相等的「功率预算（power budget）」，强在一处必弱在另一处。把武器的各项能力折算成统一货币，要求总和大致守恒。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[功率预算 总额] --&gt; B[伤害 Damage]&#10;  A --&gt; C[范围 Range]&#10;  A --&gt; D[速度 Speed]&#10;  A --&gt; E[安全性 Safety]&#10;  A --&gt; F[蓄能/资源 Cost]&#10;  B --&gt; G{总和守恒?}&#10;  C --&gt; G&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt;|超额| H[削弱某维度]&#10;  G --&gt;|不足| I[强化某维度]\">flowchart TD\n  A[功率预算 总额] --&gt; B[伤害 Damage]\n  A --&gt; C[范围 Range]\n  A --&gt; D[速度 Speed]\n  A --&gt; E[安全性 Safety]\n  A --&gt; F[蓄能/资源 Cost]\n  B --&gt; G{总和守恒?}\n  C --&gt; G\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt;|超额| H[削弱某维度]\n  G --&gt;|不足| I[强化某维度]</pre><p>一个粗略的预算守恒式可写成各维度的加权和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>D</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><mtext>const</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = w_1 D + w_2 R + w_3 S + w_4 A - w_5 C \\approx \\text{const}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">const</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 伤害、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 范围、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 出招速度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 安全性（帧优势相关）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 资源消耗。一把「高伤但起手慢、收招长」的重锤，和一把「低伤但快而安全」的匕首，应当落在相近的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 值上。功率预算把「这把武器是不是超模」从感觉变成可估算的量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"击杀时间-平衡的主尺\">击杀时间：平衡的主尺</h2><p>功率预算还需要一个体验锚点，那就是<a href=\"../hit-resolution/damage-formulas-scaling\">伤害公式</a>里定义的击杀时间（TTK）。平衡的一条铁律是：同一定位的武器，有效 TTK 应落在一个窄区间内。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>TTK</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><msub><mtext>DPS</mtext><mtext>有效</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>DPS</mtext><mtext>有效</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>单发伤害</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>命中率</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>射速</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TTK} = \\frac{HP}{\\text{DPS}_{\\text{有效}}},\\qquad \\text{DPS}_{\\text{有效}} = \\text{单发伤害} \\times \\text{命中率} \\times \\text{射速}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TTK</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DPS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">有效</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DPS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">有效</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单发伤害</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">命中率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">射速</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意是「有效 DPS」——一把理论 DPS 极高但难命中的武器，有效 DPS 可能并不出格。把命中率、弹道散布、上手难度都纳入后，很多「纸面超模」的武器其实达标。TTK 区间的宽窄是设计取向：竞技射击常把主流武器 TTK 压在很窄的带里以保公平，而 PvE 动作游戏允许更宽的区间来制造构筑差异。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>武器原型</th>\n<th>伤害</th>\n<th>射速/速度</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重击/狙</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>远/长</td>\n<td>高（收招长）</td>\n<td>高风险高回报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>突击/标准</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>全能基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快攻/冲锋</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>近</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>贴脸压制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制/辅助</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>视情</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>团队/异常</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"克制循环-用结构代替数值\">克制循环：用结构代替数值</h2><p>最稳健的平衡不靠把数字调到完全相等，而靠「克制循环」——A 克 B、B 克 C、C 克 A 的环形结构，让没有任何单一选项能统治全场。石头剪刀布是最简模型，实战中体现为：远程克近战的接近、近战克远程的走位空隙、高机动克远程的瞄准、重甲克快攻的削韧……</p>\n<p>克制循环的好处是即使某个选项数值偏强，它仍有天敌，环不会塌。设计时要确保每个原型既有它能压制的对象，也有压制它的对象——一个「谁都不太怕、也谁都打不痛」的中庸选项反而最难平衡，因为它没有进入任何循环。这种结构化平衡是<a href=\"../systems-depth/ai-combat-encounter\">战斗 AI</a>敌人搭配（近战+远程+控制）的设计依据，也呼应兄弟 hub 的 <a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/combat-balance/balancing-methods\">战斗平衡方法</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对称与不对称平衡\">对称与不对称平衡</h2><ul>\n<li>对称平衡：双方用完全相同的工具（如多数格斗游戏镜像选角的概念、对称地图），平衡只需保证每个工具内部自洽，公平性天然成立但多样性受限。</li>\n<li>不对称平衡：各阵营/角色工具迥异（MOBA 英雄、不同职业），多样性极高，但平衡难度指数上升——要保证几十个角色两两之间都不失衡，组合爆炸。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>不对称系统通常放弃「绝对平衡」，转而追求「胜率收敛 + 克制丰富」：允许角色间存在克制关系，只要总体胜率落在可接受带内（如 45%–55%），且没有角色被所有人克制或克制所有人。这条带宽怎么定、实际胜率怎么样，只能靠<a href=\"telemetry-combat-tuning\">战斗数据调优</a>去持续监控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平衡是过程-不是状态\">平衡是过程，不是状态</h2><p>最后一个关键认知：平衡不是一次算准的静态目标，而是随版本、随玩家理解演进的动态过程。玩家会发掘设计者没预见的强势打法（meta），新内容会打破旧均衡。因此现代战斗游戏把平衡做成持续调参的运营动作：小步快调、避免一次大改引发剧烈震荡，每次改动都要能用数据验证效果。这就把平衡天然交给了下一篇的遥测闭环——没有数据，平衡只是设计师的一厢情愿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>平衡的目标不是数值相等，而是让每个选项在某些场景是最优解，维持谁也不通吃的生态。</li>\n<li>功率预算要求各维度（伤害/范围/速度/安全/消耗）加权和守恒，把「超模」从感觉变成可估算的量。</li>\n<li>击杀时间（用有效 DPS 计算）是平衡主尺；克制循环用环形结构代替绝对相等，让强势选项也有天敌。</li>\n<li>不对称系统追求「胜率收敛+克制丰富」而非绝对平衡；平衡是随版本演进的持续调参过程，必须由数据闭环。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub 前置：<a href=\"../hit-resolution/damage-formulas-scaling\">伤害公式与数值缩放</a> —— 功率预算约束的数值来源。</li>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"telemetry-combat-tuning\">战斗数据调优</a> —— 用真实数据验证平衡是否达标。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/combat-balance/balancing-methods\">战斗平衡方法</a> —— 更系统的平衡方法论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"武器与技能平衡","id":"武器与技能平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：功率预算","id":"核心概念-功率预算"},{"level":2,"text":"击杀时间：平衡的主尺","id":"击杀时间-平衡的主尺"},{"level":2,"text":"克制循环：用结构代替数值","id":"克制循环-用结构代替数值"},{"level":2,"text":"对称与不对称平衡","id":"对称与不对称平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"平衡是过程，不是状态","id":"平衡是过程-不是状态"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"战斗AI与遭遇设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/systems-depth/ai-combat-encounter"},"next":{"title":"打击感与反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/balance-feel/combat-feel-feedback"}}